DESCRIPTION:Tuesday\, August 4th from 6-9pm\, Larisa will be back in Davis\, playing at Calicraft Brewing. No cover charge and great food/drinks! All ages welcome. \nAcoustic covers include some favorites by Radiohead\, U2\, The Beatles\, Fleetwood Mac\, Jewel\, Alanis Morissette\, Chris Isaak\, Imagine Dragons and more! Larisa Roberts is primarily known for her powerful\, rhythmic guitar playing and sweeping vocals\, but she will also have some looper pedal magic prepared for you! \nCalicraft Brewing Davis\n845 Russell Blvd\, Unit 10\nDavis\, CA 95616
